  "section": {
    "id": "source:1230",
    "part": 1,
    "skill": "listening",
    "title": "Part 1",
    "status": "ready",
    "assetId": "audio:1230",
    "paperId": "cambridge:20:1",
    "sentences": [
      {
        "id": "source:88857",
        "end": 40.99,
        "text": "PART 1",
        "start": 0,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88858",
        "end": 53.6,
        "text": "I've been meaning to ask you for some advice about restaurants – I need to book somewhere to celebrate my sister's 30th birthday and I liked the sound of that place you went to for your mum's 50th.",
        "start": 40.99,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88859",
        "end": 58.289,
        "text": "The Junction? Yeah, I'd definitely recommend that for a special occasion.",
        "start": 53.6,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88860",
        "end": 61.899,
        "text": "We had a great time there. Everyone really enjoyed it.",
        "start": 58.289,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88861",
        "end": 64.9,
        "text": "Where is it again? I can't remember.",
        "start": 61.899,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88862",
        "end": 69.7,
        "text": "It's on Greyson Street, only about a two minute walk from the station.",
        "start": 64.9,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88863",
        "end": 74.14,
        "text": "Oh, that's good. I'd prefer not to have to drive anywhere.",
        "start": 69.7,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88864",
        "end": 77.349,
        "text": "But I don't want to have to walk too far either.",
        "start": 74.14,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88865",
        "end": 83.14,
        "text": "Yes, the location's perfect but that's not necessarily why I'd recommend it.",
        "start": 77.349,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88866",
        "end": 91.23,
        "text": "The food's amazing. If you like fish it's probably the best restaurant in town for that.",
        "start": 83.14,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10789"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88867",
        "end": 96.849,
        "text": "It's always really fresh and there are lots of interesting dishes to choose from.",
        "start": 91.23,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88868",
        "end": 99.25,
        "text": "But all the food is good there.",
        "start": 96.849,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88869",
        "end": 101.7,
        "text": "Is it really expensive?",
        "start": 99.25,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88870",
        "end": 107.29,
        "text": "It's certainly not cheap but for a special occasion I think it's fine.",
        "start": 101.7,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88871",
        "end": 118.349,
        "text": "It's got a great atmosphere and before dinner you can go up on the roof and have a drink – it's really nice up there but you need to book.",
        "start": 107.29,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10790"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88872",
        "end": 121.89,
        "text": "It's very popular as the views are spectacular.",
        "start": 118.349,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88873",
        "end": 126.9,
        "text": "Sounds good. So that's definitely a possibility then.",
        "start": 121.89,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88874",
        "end": 129.599,
        "text": "Is there anywhere else you can think of?",
        "start": 126.9,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88875",
        "end": 135.389,
        "text": "If you want somewhere a bit less formal then you could try Paloma.",
        "start": 129.599,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88876",
        "end": 137.599,
        "text": "Where's that? I haven't heard of it.",
        "start": 135.389,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88877",
        "end": 144.4,
        "text": "No, it's quite new. It's only been open a few months but it's got a great reputation already.",
        "start": 137.599,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88878",
        "end": 148.289,
        "text": "It's in a really beautiful old building on Bow Street.",
        "start": 144.4,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88879",
        "end": 153.34,
        "text": "Oh, I think I know where you mean – right beside the cinema?",
        "start": 148.289,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88880",
        "end": 159.699,
        "text": "Yes, that's it. I've only been there a couple of times but I was really impressed.",
        "start": 153.34,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88881",
        "end": 163.55,
        "text": "The chef used to work at Don Felipe's, apparently.",
        "start": 159.699,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88882",
        "end": 166.219,
        "text": "I was really sorry when that closed down.",
        "start": 163.55,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88883",
        "end": 169.349,
        "text": "So is all the food they serve Spanish, then?",
        "start": 166.219,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10791"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88884",
        "end": 176.09,
        "text": "Yeah. You can get lots of small dishes to share – which always works really well if you're in a group.",
        "start": 169.349,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88885",
        "end": 178.289,
        "text": "Mmm. Worth thinking about.",
        "start": 176.09,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88886",
        "end": 183.889,
        "text": "Yeah. There's a lively atmosphere and the waiters are really friendly.",
        "start": 178.289,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88887",
        "end": 189,
        "text": "The only thing is that you need to pay a £50 deposit to book a table.",
        "start": 183.889,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88888",
        "end": 191.99,
        "text": "A lot of restaurants are doing that these days.",
        "start": 189,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88889",
        "end": 197.05,
        "text": "I should have a look at the menu to check there's a good choice of vegetarian dishes.",
        "start": 191.99,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10792"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88890",
        "end": 200.3,
        "text": "A couple of my friends have stopped eating meat.",
        "start": 197.05,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88891",
        "end": 251.99,
        "text": "Not sure. I'd say the selection of those would be quite limited.",
        "start": 200.3,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88892",
        "end": 254.289,
        "text": "I've just thought of another idea.",
        "start": 251.99,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88893",
        "end": 256.238,
        "text": "Have you been to The Audley?",
        "start": 254.289,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88894",
        "end": 260.798,
        "text": "No, don't think I've heard of it. How's it spelt?",
        "start": 256.238,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88895",
        "end": 269.79,
        "text": "A-U-D-L-E-Y. You must have heard of it – there's been a lot about it in the press.",
        "start": 260.798,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10793"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88896",
        "end": 276.029,
        "text": "I don't tend to pay much attention to that kind of thing. So where is it exactly?",
        "start": 269.79,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88897",
        "end": 280.689,
        "text": "It's in that hotel near Baxter Bridge – on the top floor.",
        "start": 276.029,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88898",
        "end": 284.1,
        "text": "Oh, the views would be incredible from up there.",
        "start": 280.689,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88899",
        "end": 286.579,
        "text": "Yeah. I'd love to go.",
        "start": 284.1,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88900",
        "end": 293.189,
        "text": "I can't think of the chef's name but she was a judge on that TV cookery show recently.",
        "start": 286.579,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88901",
        "end": 295.8,
        "text": "And she's written a couple of cookery books.",
        "start": 293.189,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88902",
        "end": 298.16,
        "text": "Oh, Angela Frayn.",
        "start": 295.8,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88903",
        "end": 304.389,
        "text": "That's the one. Anyway, it's had excellent reviews from all the newspapers.",
        "start": 298.16,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10794"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88904",
        "end": 308,
        "text": "That would be a memorable place for a celebration.",
        "start": 304.389,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88905",
        "end": 316,
        "text": "Definitely. Obviously it's worth going there just for the view but the food is supposed to be really special.",
        "start": 308,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88906",
        "end": 320.149,
        "text": "She only likes cooking with local products, doesn't she?",
        "start": 316,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10795",
          "question:10796"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88907",
        "end": 329.3,
        "text": "Yes. Everything at the restaurant has to be sourced within a short distance and absolutely nothing flown in from abroad.",
        "start": 320.149,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88908",
        "end": 332.5,
        "text": "I imagine it's really expensive though.",
        "start": 329.3,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88909",
        "end": 335.55,
        "text": "Well, you could go for the set lunch.",
        "start": 332.5,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88910",
        "end": 341.149,
        "text": "That's quite reasonable for a top class restaurant: £30 a head.",
        "start": 335.55,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10797"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88911",
        "end": 345.35,
        "text": "In the evening I think it'd be more like £50.",
        "start": 341.149,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88912",
        "end": 350.72,
        "text": "At least that, I should think. But I'm sure everyone would enjoy it.",
        "start": 345.35,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88913",
        "end": 356.459,
        "text": "It's not the kind of place you leave feeling hungry though, is it? With tiny portions?",
        "start": 350.72,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88914",
        "end": 362.54,
        "text": "No, the reviews I've read didn't mention that. I imagine they'd be average.",
        "start": 356.459,
        "alignment": "source",
        "questionIds": [
          "question:10798"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source:88915",
        "end": 365.332,
        "text": "Well, that's all great, thanks …",
        "start": 362.69100000000003,
        "alignment": "generated",
        "questionIds": [],
